  "description": "Proposed roof terrace (retrospective)&nbsp;",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;Within 3 months of the date of this decision, a policy-compliant &lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13.3333px; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;nesting box for swifts, sparrows, starlings, and/or bats shall be installed in accordance with the manufacturer&#x27;s specifications and retained for the lifetime of the development. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13.3333px; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;REASON:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13.3333px; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt; To provide a biodiversity uplift at the site&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 13.3333px; white-space-collapse: preserve; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "<p>The Development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly in accordance with the submitted plans hereby approved and any subsequent approval of details.\r\n</p><p><br></p><p>\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full accordance with the plans hereby approved.\r\n</p>",
    "&lt;p&gt;The privacy screening shown on the plans hereby approved on the southern and eastern parapet shall be installed at a minimum of 1.8 metres in height when measured from the\r\nfloor of the terrace. The screening shall be installed within one month of the date of this decision and maintained thereafter.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;REASON: To ensure that the amenities of the neighbouring occupiers is protected.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
